    "difficultyReason": "Parts a-d fully scaffold the sequence: rearrange 2x-3y+6=0 to gradient form, read the gradient, take the negative reciprocal, then apply point-gradient with (4,-1). Demand is a linked routine procedure with a general-form rearrangement, negative signs and a fractional gradient. It is above the single-step perpendicular-line table p22-q6, but below p25-q11, which has no sub-steps for the midpoint and perpendicular bisector.",
